WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
The way we think, feel, and act helps us know who we are and how others see us.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.320
This is why we say the world around us helps shape who we are.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.480
For some people this can be hard to hear. No one wants bad things to decide who they are.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.199
But the good news is, we can change. We can change by being around good and positive things too.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.640
Just like the world around us helped create triggers, sometimes we can be in places that help get rid of

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.160
them. For example, if Mike joins track and runs every day, he might get stronger, feel proud,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.280
and see that Mr. Ramos' mean words didn't really matter.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.719
Mike might also start writing down what he thinks and feels.

00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:39.920
This can help him let some of his feelings out. We are going to try this later and see how it works.

